\n\n來了之後才發現沒有推出我朋友推薦的口味\n似乎菜單會不定期更換\n本次嘗試的是\n\n雜巾豚骨麵200\n麵還ok\n但不像拉麵⋯比較像是扁的烏龍麵\n湯頭。暫無想法。\n調味粉的味道蓋過了不好判斷\n叉燒肉。還ok。反而肉的調味較少\n整體來說\n應該會先注意到的是，日式拉麵來說價格真的相當便宜，但吃起來又不像在吃日式拉麵\n\n牛油炒豆芽高麗菜60\n吃起來就像是鐵板燒固定提供的那盤菜🤣\n\n豬腳煮100\n看起來像是麵裡那塊肉的一兩倍的大小的肉\n吃起來好像也真的就是這樣\n\n整體來說\n還是得說。口感跟知道的日式拉麵都不一樣\n\n未來可能再試試其他麵吧",null,[0,29]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPZEdOdE5URldiVlp4VTJ3NGVWUkdhRnBaVld4VFpIcEdjbUZXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7688,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OdGNtNTFWbVZxU2w4eVRGaFpZVWxTZHpGcmFWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x71a680846c0caf7a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmNtcm51VmVqSl8yTFhZYUlSdzFraVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OdGNtNTFWbVZxU2w4eVRGaFpZVWxTZHpGcmFWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OdGNtNTFWbVZxU2w4eVRGaFpZVWxTZHpGcmFWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OdGNtN