7bbvtKWAxUObPUHHe7uFFgQ3IcHCKgBKBA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["勝王變成牛骨鬼金棒了。點了辣麻牛味噌拉麵+炒豆芽，師傅直接把豆芽加在拉麵上，炒豆芽很好吃，牛骨白湯也很好喝，但我沒去注意味噌的味道，久沒吃鬼金棒，這次辣麻都選少量，雖辣但不至於流汗，少麻對我來說還不夠過癮，下次要選麻普通。因為算是重口味的湯，桌上有提供某某醋，可以用來轉味。角煮裡面是漂亮的粉紅色，似乎是牛肉。(2026.1.25)",null,[0,166]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvYVZKR1ozcGlTRTVKWkZVeE0xa3hVa1JhTVdSelRUQnJOVlV4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,10092,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoaVJGZ3piSE5JZFUxM1kxUkRaMWRzTTBrNVUxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x71a680846c0caf7a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlhiRFgzbHNIdU13Y1RDZ1dsM0k5U1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoaVJGZ3piSE5JZFUxM1kxUkRaMWRzTTBrNVUxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoaVJGZ3piSE5JZFUxM1kxUkRaMWRzTTBrNVUxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoaVJGZ